{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01NHmhsYG6vX4r3PgdAkvNKZ", "type": "tool_result", "content": "{\"result\":\"### mcp:crm-eu/create_note\\n\\nAttach a timestamped note to a contact or deal record.\\n\\n**Call**: `await crm_eu_create_note(record_id=<string>, body=<string>)`\\n\\n**Parameters**\\n- `record_id` (string, required)\\n- `body` (string, required)\\n\\n### mcp:crm/create_note\\n\\nAttach a timestamped note to a contact or deal record.\\n\\n**Call**: `await crm_create_note(record_id=<string>, body=<string>)`\\n\\n**Parameters**\\n- `record_id` (string, required)\\n- `body` (string, required)\\n\\n### mcp:orders/get_order\\n\\nFetch one order record: order_id, region, amount, status.\\n\\n**Call**: `await orders_get_order(order_id=<string>)`\\n\\n**Parameters**\\n- `order_id` (string, required)\\n\\n**Returns**\\n- `value` (object)\\n\\n### mcp:orders/list_order_ids\\n\\nList every order id in the store.\\n\\n**Call**: `await orders_list_order_ids()`\\n\\n**Parameters**\\n*(no parameters)*\\n\\n**Returns**\\n- `result` (string[], required)\\n\\n### mcp:tickets-eu/add_comment\\n\\nAppend a public or internal comment to a ticket.\\n\\n**Call**: `await tickets_eu_add_comment(ticket_id=<integer>, body=<string>, internal=<boolean>)`\\n\\n**Parameters**\\n- `ticket_id` (integer, required)\\n- `body` (string, required)\\n- `internal` (boolean, required)\\n\\n### mcp:tickets/add_comment\\n\\nAppend a public or internal comment to a ticket.\\n\\n**Call**: `await tickets_add_comment(ticket_id=<integer>, body=<string>, internal=<boolean>)`\\n\\n**Parameters**\\n- `ticket_id` (integer, required)\\n- `body` (string, required)\\n- `internal` (boolean, required)\\n\\nRules for execute_code snippets: every binding is async \u2014 always `await`; call capability functions with keywords exactly as shown (positional calls fail on the default backend); awaiting a capability returns the tool's plain value, already unwrapped \u2014 nev